OL,3,AHungarian authorities uncover $20m
OL,4,Aduring probe of Orban-era minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly $20m (#14.8m) in cash has been
OL,7,Ffound hidden in farm buildings and
OL,8,Fburied in forests as part of an
OL,9,Finvestigation into a former minister of
OL,10,FViktor Orban, authorities have said.
OL,12,FMiklos Sesztak, who served as minister
OL,13,Fof national development for four of the
OL,14,Fex-prime minister's 16-year rule, is
OL,15,Faccused of accepting bribes as part of
OL,16,Fa scheme involving the state transport
OL,17,Fcompany. He has denied any wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
