OL,3,AHungarian authorities uncover $20m
OL,4,Aduring probe of Orban-era minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FHungary's new Prime Minister Peter
OL,7,FMagyar unseated Orban in a landslide
OL,8,Felection in April on the promise of
OL,9,Flaunching a sweeping anti-corruption
OL,10,Fdrive.
OL,12,FOn Friday, following the two-day search
OL,13,Ffor the cash - found in secluded
OL,14,Flocations across the country - Magyar
OL,15,Fdescribed it as the end of the "mafia".
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
